OL,3,GNEWSAParking restrictions approved
OL,4,Aoutside four schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew parking restrictions will be
OL,7,Fintroduced outside four schools in
OL,8,FLincolnshire.
OL,10,FDouble-yellow lines will be replaced
OL,11,Fwith no-waiting or no-loading markings
OL,12,Foutside Carlton Academy in Lincoln,
OL,13,Fwith similar rules also being
OL,14,Fintroduced near Gipsey Bridge Academy,
OL,15,FLong Bennington Church of England
OL,16,FAcademy, and John Harrox Primary School
OL,17,Fin Moulton.
OL,19,FThe measures were approved at a
OL,20,FLincolnshire County Council planning
OL,21,Fcommittee meeting on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
