OL,3,GNEWSAParking restrictions approved
OL,4,Aoutside four schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Martin Christopher, who
OL,7,Frepresents the area that includes
OL,8,FCarlton Academy in Lincoln, said: "None
OL,9,Fof the areas proposed are designated
OL,10,Fparking zones, there is no real loss of
OL,11,Fsafe drop-off locations."
